###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Energy RMSEs are stated in eV/atom and converted exactly to meV/atom (the original value is in the location). Virial RMSEs (1.48e-1, 2.05e-1, 3.37e-1, 6.85e-1 in eV/A3 atom) have no schema unit and are not encoded as metrics.
# - Table 1 says the RMSEs are 'for different system sizes used in the AIMD training set' while Sec. 2 says they are computed across the validation datasets; the role follows Sec. 2. Elastic constants (Table 2), phonons and VDOS are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/hawthorne2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

